  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual>, <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/mpdo/core#CradletoGateSystemBoundary>;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Semi-Continuous Cradle-to-Gate System Boundary Process 1";
